{"seq":3,"slug":"responsive-design","title":"响应式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/responsive-design","wordCount":567,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"响应式设计\">响应式设计</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>响应式设计（Responsive Design）让同一套代码适配不同屏幕尺寸——从手机到超宽显示器。核心工具包括媒体查询、流式排版和现代 CSS 函数。移动优先（Mobile-First）策略是当前行业共识，从最小屏幕开始设计，逐步增强大屏体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>响应式设计由三个支柱支撑：<strong>媒体查询</strong>按视口特征切换样式、<strong>流式布局</strong>用相对单位（<code>%</code>/<code>fr</code>/<code>clamp()</code>）让尺寸随容器伸缩、<strong>断点</strong>在内容开始&quot;挤坏&quot;的位置划分布局形态；移动优先意味着基础样式服务小屏，再用 <code>min-width</code> 逐级增强。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;移动端 320px+&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;平板 768px+&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;桌面 1024px+&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;大屏 1440px+&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"移动端 320px+\"] --&gt; B[\"平板 768px+\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"桌面 1024px+\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"大屏 1440px+\"]</pre><h2 id=\"媒体查询\">媒体查询</h2><h3 id=\"基础语法\">基础语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 移动优先：默认样式 = 移动端 */&#10;.container {&#10;  padding: 1rem;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 平板及以上 */&#10;@media (min-width: 768px) {&#10;  .container {&#10;    padding: 2rem;&#10;    max-width: 720px;&#10;    margin: 0 auto;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 桌面及以上 */&#10;@media (min-width: 1024px) {&#10;  .container {&#10;    max-width: 960px;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 大屏 */&#10;@media (min-width: 1440px) {&#10;  .container {&#10;    max-width: 1200px;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 移动优先：默认样式 = 移动端 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 平板及以上 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min-width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    max-width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">720</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </spa