<code>block-size</code></td>\n<td>块尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"viewport-单位\">viewport 单位</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".hero {&#10;  min-height: 100dvh; /* 动态视口高度，解决移动端地址栏问题 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;.full-bleed {&#10;  width: 100vw;&#10;  margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.hero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  min-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">dvh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 动态视口高度，解决移动端地址栏问题 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.full-bleed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin-inline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">vw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>vh/vw</code></td>\n<td>视口高度/宽度的 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dvh/dvw</code></td>\n<td>动态视口（排除浏览器 UI）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>svh/svw</code></td>\n<td>小视口（最小可能）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lvh/lvw</code></td>\n<td>大视口（最大可能）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>移动优先</strong>策略：默认样式针对小屏，用 <code>min-width</code> 媒体查询逐步增强</li>\n<li><strong><code>clamp()</code></strong> 是流式排版的核心函数，同时设置最小、首选和最大值</li>\n<li>现代媒体查询支持<strong>范围语法</strong>（<code>width &gt;= 768px</code>）和<strong>偏好查询</strong>（<code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>无媒体查询的响应式网格</strong>：<code>repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(250px, 100%), 1fr))</code></li>\n<li><strong>逻辑属性</strong>（<code>margin-inline</code>、<code>padding-block</code>）支持多书写方向</li>\n<li><strong><code>dvh</code></strong> 解决移动端视口高度不一致的问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"响应式设计","id":"响应式设计"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"媒体查询","id":"媒体查询"},{"level":3,"text":"基础语法","id":"基础语法"},{"level":3,"text":"常用断点","id":"常用断点"},{"level":3,"text":"现代媒体查询语法","id":"现代媒体查询语法"},{"level":2,"text":"移动优先策略","id":"移动优先策略"},{"level":2,"text":"流式排版","id":"流式排版"},{"level":3,"text":"clamp() 函数","id":"clamp-函数"},{"level":3,"text":"流式间距系统","id":"流式间距系统"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式图片","id":"响应式图片"},{"level":2,"text":"响应式布局技巧","id":"响应式布局技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"无媒体查询的响应式网格","id":"无媒体查询的响应式网格"},{"level":3,"text":"逻辑属性","id":"逻辑属性"},{"